{"title": "Black Puddle (surface)", "pageid": 54934, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Black_Puddle_(surface)", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Black Puddle (surface) image\" src=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Black Puddle</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a>. It inflicts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Despair_(Condition)\" title=\"Despair (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Despair\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Despair_(Condition)\" title=\"Despair (Condition)\">Despair</a> to those standing on it.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Despair\"> Condition: Despair </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Despair_(Condition)\" title=\"Despair (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Despair\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Despair_(Condition)\" title=\"Despair (Condition)\">Despair</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Despondency from deep within the Shadowfell has perforated your very being.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rotting Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\">Rotting Regurgitation</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>This surface never seems to appear in-game, probably due to a bug. It is supposed to be created by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thisobald Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a>. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202229\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1384/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13012/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3637/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 491/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 833837/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.987      1 Template:Area_page\n100.00%   49.987      1 -total\n 55.60%   27.792      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 49.55%   24.771      1 Template:PageSeo\n 48.96%   24.474      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 39.47%   19.731      1 Template:Cond\n 35.75%   17.870      4 Template:Icon_link\n 34.69%   17.343      4 Template:Icon_text\n 30.26%   15.125     10 Template:Trim\n 27.61%   13.803      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:i